h Jr., and has benefited from visible activity including bill passages and a visit from Speaker Johnson. Smith has drawn some attention, including a VoteVets-endorsed slate and local media interviews, but little money.\n\nEvery major race rater calls the district Safe or Likely Republican, and prediction markets price Murphy's chances near 85 percent. A single Democratic-sponsored August poll showed a surprisingly narrow 3-point race, but it carries little weight. The forecast expects Murphy to win by roughly ten points, with the seat rated Likely Republican.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0988, "margin": -7.94}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0384, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0979, "margin": -9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0491, "margin": -10.0}]}